ntab hours (c287-c288). No open questions remain in\n  this class.\n\n## Instrument note\n\n- int3's run.cgi initially returned the command echo with no output\n  until a fresh login cookie was used -- the run.cgi output follows the\n  command echo; parse AFTER the echo line (recipe detail for the next\n  census).","filepath":"/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/boot-activation-census-c289-2026-09-13.md"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:09:17.530675346Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:09:17.607448202Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":6839679104,"prompt_eval_count":155820,"prompt_eval_cached_count":147840,"eval_count":680}\n(203a45170084e67e806509be83f32392 . 623)
