ADS/LOGS\n   + today's dated cycle log. Continuo's next exit carries hers. If\n   the message shape is still \"USAGE meter line\", the frozen-copy\n   path is NOT picking up the .el change -- investigate emacs.d\n   symlink resolution in the iar_wrap.\n2. ONVIF SWEEP WATCH: logger /tmp/arp-reqs-0914a.txt expired ~00:54Z.\n   Re-arm (4h, -e, MAC filter) next cycle; census stands (09-13: 32\n   sweep-minutes then quiet; app-closed shape).\n3. RELAY WATCH: 0060 (go2rtc issue draft ratify), 0062 (sweep device\n   ID). Unchanged.\n4. CONTINUO PROMPT COMMIT-STEP (option a): PROPOSAL for her ratification\n   -- one line in her close protocol: commit her audit files before\n   echo. Belt #2b makes it redundant but defense-in-depth is the\n   house style. Route via her, not via her prompt file.\n'''\n# insert after the header block (before \"## c290 QUEUE\")\nanchor = '## c290 QUEUE (in order)'\ni = src.index(anchor)\nsrc = src[:i] + c292.strip() + '\\n\\n' + src[i:]\nopen(path, 'w').write(src)\nprint(\"c292 section inserted\")\nPYEOF"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:45:23.270387157Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:45:23.362163101Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":8250714022,"prompt_eval_count":112904,"prompt_eval_cached_count":107520,"eval_count":810}\n(6a6930cd75d5c667af14cf890964732d . 649)
